{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And they returned and wept.</b> They returned to acting like complainers, to test, and wept now over having left Egypt, rejecting the excellence of the Shechinah's dwelling among them — as He testified in saying (Numbers 11:20): יַעַן כִּי מְאַסְתֶּם אֶת ה׳ אֲשֶׁר בְּקִרְבְּכֶם וַתִּבְכּוּ לְפָנָיו לֵאמֹר לָמָּה זֶּה יָצָאנוּ מִמִּצְרָיִם." "<b>Who will give us meat to eat.</b> To test whether He would provide food for His people, as the psalmist testified in saying (Psalms 78:18): וַיְנַסּוּ אֵל בִּלְבָבָם לִשְׁאָל־אֹכֶל לְנַפְשָׁם."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:19.767884911Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}